pmw:EvagriusKephalaiaGnosticaSyriac a dcterms:BibliographicResource ;
    rdfs:label "Evagrius, Kephalaia Gnostica in the Syriac recension"@en, "Evagrius, Kephalaia Gnostica in der syrischen Rezension"@de ;
